{"5054650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon Breaker: Endless Arcade", "steam_appid": 5054650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Breaker is a fun horizontal shmup 3d retro shooter in the legacy of the great action arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar twin stick gameplay with a polished and modernized look &amp; feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No backstory and no one to rescue! Just pure adrenaline action and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the skies and have fun doing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, evade, hunt &amp; get hunted while making everything explode as you clear waves for points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits playing through endless waves to unlock new leaderboard high scores and gameplay cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/d8041ebd03579d69647c2974ea91371c.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/d8041ebd03579d69647c2974ea91371c.avif?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/30e6d39ec63aec0c770535271a8050d1.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/30e6d39ec63aec0c770535271a8050d1.avif?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Classic</strong>: for that managed chaos. Things explode predictably and on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Anomaly</strong>: rogue-like twist with 50+ cards! Make each run memorable with different gameplay mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Normal</strong>: no continues, all achievements, contribute to online leaderboards, provides a good challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Rookie</strong>: 1 continue slot, only 8 unlock-able achievements, no online leaderboards, easier chill fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Ships :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The <strong>Neon Breaker</strong> is your trusty balanced fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The <strong>Dropzoner</strong> is fast, fragile and furious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Each with different life/shield profile, both able to boost out of danger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Bolt</strong>, dependable message spreader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Lancet</strong>, longer range piercing negotiator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Pulse</strong>,  personal space management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Cycle between weapons for overcharge bonus.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Mega Bomb</strong> &amp; <strong>Ultra Bomb</strong>, quick conflict resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10+ stackable pickups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coop play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local &amp; remote with cross-play support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Invite friends, play on the public lobby or with local AI pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple 80s neon themed music reactive procedural sci-fi worlds. (<strong>Space</strong>, <strong>Alien</strong>, <strong>Ocean</strong>, <strong>Cyberpunk</strong>,  <strong>Vortex</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-120 unique waves for a full repeatable run for endless gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Synthwave music soundtrack that ticks all the good vibes. (20+)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Configurable VFX settings (Bloom, Filmic tone-mapping, DOF, letterbox, volumetric, high FPS support..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mini map support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cast :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-20 varied disposable enemy unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-6 mini boss map controllers to give you trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-20 unique herald bosses to give you a real challenge. (plus bonus looting interludes on defeating them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scoring :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chain kills for up to x8 score combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Finish waves early for x2 bonus on next wave. Or finish late and be hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Anomaly cards to trade score multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/395888f324ab452993a601c3f6bd5eac.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/395888f324ab452993a601c3f6bd5eac.webp?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Stylized low poly 3d retro visuals inspired by 80s action arcade game cabinets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rich full 3d Gallery and music Jukebox with support for custom soundtracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Replay system so you can easily share and analyze your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Localization in English, French, Spanish and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Steam leaderboards for Classic and Anomaly modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Arcade cabinet style demo attraction mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2 different 3d gameplay camera play modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-60 achievement awards to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Defeat up to thousands of enemies per wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play against up to 300 enemy units on screen at any one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Physics of mass debris destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Supports 60 to 144+ fps even on low end specs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Remappable controls, mouse, keyboards, and controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/d84aa87ac2cb3be7c81d0d9338933ad8.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/d84aa87ac2cb3be7c81d0d9338933ad8.webp?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/8ae4d95f46b9b14863d90d04b8e8fac1.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/8ae4d95f46b9b14863d90d04b8e8fac1.webp?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Breaker is a fun horizontal shmup 3d retro shooter in the legacy of the great action arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar twin stick gameplay with a polished and modernized look &amp; feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No backstory and no one to rescue! Just pure adrenaline action and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the skies and have fun doing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, evade, hunt &amp; get hunted while making everything explode as you clear waves for points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits playing through endless waves to unlock new leaderboard high scores and gameplay cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/d8041ebd03579d69647c2974ea91371c.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/d8041ebd03579d69647c2974ea91371c.avif?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/30e6d39ec63aec0c770535271a8050d1.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/30e6d39ec63aec0c770535271a8050d1.avif?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Classic</strong>: for that managed chaos. Things explode predictably and on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Anomaly</strong>: rogue-like twist with 50+ cards! Make each run memorable with different gameplay mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Normal</strong>: no continues, all achievements, contribute to online leaderboards, provides a good challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Rookie</strong>: 1 continue slot, only 8 unlock-able achievements, no online leaderboards, easier chill fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Ships :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The <strong>Neon Breaker</strong> is your trusty balanced fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The <strong>Dropzoner</strong> is fast, fragile and furious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Each with different life/shield profile, both able to boost out of danger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Bolt</strong>, dependable message spreader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Lancet</strong>, longer range piercing negotiator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Pulse</strong>,  personal space management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Cycle between weapons for overcharge bonus.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Mega Bomb</strong> &amp; <strong>Ultra Bomb</strong>, quick conflict resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10+ stackable pickups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coop play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local &amp; remote with cross-play support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Invite friends, play on the public lobby or with local AI pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple 80s neon themed music reactive procedural sci-fi worlds. (<strong>Space</strong>, <strong>Alien</strong>, <strong>Ocean</strong>, <strong>Cyberpunk</strong>,  <strong>Vortex</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-120 unique waves for a full repeatable run for endless gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Synthwave music soundtrack that ticks all the good vibes. (20+)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Configurable VFX settings (Bloom, Filmic tone-mapping, DOF, letterbox, volumetric, high FPS support..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mini map support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cast :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-20 varied disposable enemy unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-6 mini boss map controllers to give you trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-20 unique herald bosses to give you a real challenge. (plus bonus looting interludes on defeating them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scoring :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chain kills for up to x8 score combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Finish waves early for x2 bonus on next wave. Or finish late and be hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Anomaly cards to trade score multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/395888f324ab452993a601c3f6bd5eac.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/395888f324ab452993a601c3f6bd5eac.webp?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Stylized low poly 3d retro visuals inspired by 80s action arcade game cabinets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rich full 3d Gallery and music Jukebox with support for custom soundtracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Replay system so you can easily share and analyze your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Localization in English, French, Spanish and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Steam leaderboards for Classic and Anomaly modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Arcade cabinet style demo attraction mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2 different 3d gameplay camera play modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-60 achievement awards to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Defeat up to thousands of enemies per wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play against up to 300 enemy units on screen at any one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Physics of mass debris destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Supports 60 to 144+ fps even on low end specs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Remappable controls, mouse, keyboards, and controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/d84aa87ac2cb3be7c81d0d9338933ad8.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/d84aa87ac2cb3be7c81d0d9338933ad8.webp?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras/8ae4d95f46b9b14863d90d04b8e8fac1.avif?t=1787767855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/extras_big/8ae4d95f46b9b14863d90d04b8e8fac1.webp?t=1787767855 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Neon Breaker is a fun twin-stick horizontal 3d retro shoot 'em up in the legacy of the great action arcade shmup classics. Shoot, evade, and hunt down cute enemy ships to make them all explode! Push your limits playing through endless waves and unlock new high scores.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/c93e09fcf45c0bf37b9085c0b77eae6e01a393dd/header.jpg?t=1787767855", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/46a1e1cd44f1ae74991cb8816a9ad25afba1e8fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787767855", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5054650/46a1e1cd44f1ae74991cb8816a9ad25afba1e8fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787767855", "website": "https://pixel-hat.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 960m GTX or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15 Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Roy Massaad"], "publishers": ["Roy Massaad"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 39, "description": "Shared/Split Screen Co-op"}, {"id": 24, "description": "Shared/Split Screen"}, {"id": 27, "description": "Cross-Platform Multiplayer"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 75, "description": "